.TH TESSERA-PACKAGE 8 "" "Tessera" "System administration"
.SH NAME
tessera-package \- Tessera system helper
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
tessera-package configure-core|configure-web
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Apply the native package configuration migrations. Run by dpkg and the packaged migration oneshots; administrators normally use apt or the bundle installer.
.SH SEE ALSO
tesserad(8), tesseractl(1)
